WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.297
The timing must support a useful decision Daniel checks

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:06.692
why the decision is needed at this time and

00:00:06.784 --> 00:00:10.126
what would happen if it were delayed He records

00:00:10.178 --> 00:00:13.310
the intended result and review point in T1 .

00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:17.113
1 The preparation period and the meeting are separate

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:20.731
commitments so a conflicting appointment affects both
